# Terms that must never appear in this repository: one per line.
#
# Copy this file to `.blocklist` at the repository root (it is ignored by git)
# and replace the examples below with the real terms. Never commit the real
# list. In CI, put the same terms in the BLOCKLIST environment variable,
# separated by newlines or commas.
#
# Matching ignores case and accents and works inside longer words. A space in
# a term also matches "-", "_", "." or nothing.
acme corp
globex
